Package: CyFj11
Type: Package
Title: Parse and Extract Data from FlowJo v11 Workspace Files
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Bernd", "Jagla",
    email   = "bernd.jagla@pasteur.fr",
    role    = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))  # replace with real ORCID
Description: Provides functions to parse FlowJo v11 workspace files
    (.flowjo) and extract gating information, populations, and associated
    FCS files. Includes utilities for exporting data to FlowJo v10
    workspace format. The package enables bidirectional data flow between
    FlowJo and R/Bioconductor, facilitating reproducible analysis
    workflows.
